{
  "about": "What the dashboard shows and why (SQMeter spec 025; the Status card, SQMeter spec 026). The Status card shows only what no other card shows: the imaging app and whether alerts go out, plus problems nothing else shows (DS-08). Every field of the status, readings, safety and alerts-armed schemas and every settings-dependency id is mapped here: shown (with a test in web/tests/dashboard.spec.ts) or not shown (with a reason). Checked by tools/dashboard/check.py (DASH-02).",
